    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Goya, a young raccoon determined to complete your village\u2019s sacred rite of passage. To prove yourself, you must face \u2014 and defeat \u2014 nine fearsome opponents in a relentless gauntlet. Will you overcome the trials and earn the right to leave your village and explore the world beyond?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forest Rites is a card battler inspired by trick-taking games. It\u2019s meant to be a compact, gameplay-driven experience with very light narrative elements. I made this between 2021 and 2024 in my spare time as a fun experiment around a rarely-seen mechanic in video games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short length (30 to 45 minutes per game)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelike progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your opponents through a card system inspired by trick-taking games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the forest's masters, each with their own fighting style and strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two modes available: beginner and normal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In normal mode, your score is saved at the end of each game: try to beat your best score and climb the leaderboard!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Goya, a young raccoon determined to complete your village\u2019s sacred rite of passage. To prove yourself, you must face \u2014 and defeat \u2014 nine fearsome opponents in a relentless gauntlet. Will you overcome the trials and earn the right to leave your village and explore the world beyond?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forest Rites is a card battler inspired by trick-taking games. It\u2019s meant to be a compact, gameplay-driven experience with very light narrative elements. I made this between 2021 and 2024 in my spare time as a fun experiment around a rarely-seen mechanic in video games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short length (30 to 45 minutes per game)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelike progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your opponents through a card system inspired by trick-taking games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the forest's masters, each with their own fighting style and strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two modes available: beginner and normal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In normal mode, your score is saved at the end of each game: try to beat your best score and climb the leaderboard!</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Defeat the forest's masters in this exciting trick-taking card battler!",
